=Parentheses%20Books%2076%20W%20Gay%20St%20Harrisonburg%20VA","access_notes":"Consult the shop’s current event announcements before planning around a reading or story time.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rocktown-bicycles-s-mason-000","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Rocktown Bicycles","title":"Make the Mason Street Bike Stop","subtitle":"00 block of South Mason Street","notes":"Roll or walk to the South Mason storefront for bicycle service, route information, or equipment before exploring farther afield.","short_summary":"A South Mason block anchored by a locally operated bicycle shop and service counter.","evidence_claim":"Rocktown Bicycles operates at 50 South Mason Street, Suite 100, and offers bicycle service and route information.","source_url":"https://www.rocktownbicycles.com/","source_title":"Rocktown Bicycles","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Rocktown%20Bicycles%2050%20S%20Mason%20St%20Harrisonburg%20VA","access_notes":"Official hours are Monday–Friday 11 a.m.–7 p.m. and Saturday 10 a.m.–4 p.m.; the shop is closed Sunday.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"harrisonburg-farmers-market-s-liberty-200","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Harrisonburg Farmers Market","title":"Time the Block for Market Morning","subtitle":"200 block of South Liberty Street","notes":"Arrive during a scheduled market session to meet producers and browse seasonal food, plants, prepared items, and local crafts.","short_summary":"A South Liberty market block activated year-round by regional growers and makers.","evidence_claim":"Harrisonburg Farmers Market operates at 228 South Liberty Street, with Tuesday and Saturday markets from April through November and Saturday winter markets.","source_url":"https://www.harrisonburgfarmersmarket.com/contact","source_title":"Contact | Harrisonburg Farmers Market","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Harrisonburg%20Farmers%20Market%20228%20S%20Liberty%20St%20Harrisonburg%20VA","access_notes":"April–November sessions are Tuesday and Saturday 8 a.m.–1 p.m.; December–March sessions are Saturday 9 a.m.–1 p.m.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"westover-park-s-dogwood-300","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Westover Park","title":"Choose a Recreation Loop","subtitle":"300 block of South Dogwood Drive","notes":"Head down South Dogwood and choose one activity: follow the disc-golf course, use the skate park, or pause at a picnic shelter.","short_summary":"A South Dogwood recreation corridor gathering multiple outdoor facilities in one municipal park.","evidence_claim":"Westover Park at 305 South Dogwood Drive is a 48-acre city park with a skate park, disc-golf course, playground, picnic shelters, pool complex, and activity center.","source_url":"https://www.harrisonburgva.gov/westover","source_title":"Westover Park | City of Harrisonburg, VA","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Westover%20Park%20305%20S%20Dogwood%20Dr%20Harrisonburg%20VA","access_notes":"Individual facilities have separate schedules and conditions; consult the linked city pages before using the pool or skate park.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ralph-sampson-park-e-washington-400","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Ralph Sampson Park","title":"Walk the Park’s Short Trail","subtitle":"400 block of East Washington Street","notes":"Use the East Washington entrance for a short walking loop, or bring a ball for the basketball and futsal courts shown on the park map.","short_summary":"An East Washington park block with a mapped walking route and several active-recreation spaces.","evidence_claim":"The city map places Ralph Sampson Park at 431 East Washington Street and identifies walking routes, basketball courts, a futsal complex, playground, shelters, and spraygrounds.","source_url":"https://www.harrisonburgva.gov/sites/default/files/parks/images/Ralph%20Sampson%20Park%2011x17.pdf","source_title":"Ralph Sampson Park Map | City of Harrisonburg","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2025-04-30","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ralph%20Sampson%20Park%20431%20E%20Washington%20St%20Harrisonburg%20VA","access_notes":"The city map notes that restrooms operate seasonally from mid-April to late October and dogs must remain leashed.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lucy-f-simms-center-simms-600","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Lucy F. Simms Continuing Education Center","title":"Read the Permanent Simms Exhibit","subtitle":"600 block of Simms Avenue","notes":"Enter from Simms Avenue and ask to see the permanent exhibit documenting the school and Northeast neighborhood’s contributions.","short_summary":"A Simms Avenue civic destination preserving local Black educational and neighborhood history.","evidence_claim":"The Lucy F. Simms Continuing Education Center at 620 Simms Avenue permanently houses an exhibit about the Lucy F. Simms School and Harrisonburg’s Northeast neighborhood.","source_url":"https://www.harrisonburgva.gov/simms-center","source_title":"Lucy F. Simms Continuing Education Center | City of Harrisonburg, VA","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lucy%20F.%20Simms%